Package: dockpipe
Version: 0.6.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: bash, git
Suggests: docker.io | docker-ce
Maintainer: dockpipe maintainers
Description: Run commands, packages and workflows across native and container runtimes
 Dockpipe runs host and container workflows with managed environments and packages.
 Docker is needed only for workflows that use containers.
